</code>

In this code block, the <code>PUT_AddContract</code> method adds an element to the array list. The assert statements check if the count of elements in the array list increased by 1, if the added element existed in the array list before adding (which should be false) and if the added element is in the array list after adding (which should be true and the index should be within the [0, count - 1] range).

<code>
