Debug.Assert(Old_arrListIndexOfX >= 0 && Old_arrListIndexOfX < New_arrListCount);
Debug.Assert(Old_arrListLastIndexOfX == -1);
</code>

In this code block, the <code>PUT_RemoveContract</code> method removes an element from the array list. The assert statements check if the count of elements in the array list decreased by 1, if the removed element existed in the array list before removing (which should be true) and if the removed element is not in the array list after removing (which should be false, and the index should be within the [0, count - 1] range), and if the last index of the removed element is -1 which implies that the removed element was the last occurrence.

<code>
Debug.Assert(New_arrListCount == Old_arrListCount);
Debug.Assert(New_arrListIndexOfX == Old_arrListIndexOfX + 1 || New_arrListIndexOfX == Old_arrListIndexOfX);
