Debug.Assert(New_arrListContainsX == Old_arrListContainsX);
</code>

In this code block, the <code>PUT_InsertContract</code> method inserts an element at a particular index in the array list. The assert statements check if the count of elements in the array list remains the same as before, if the inserted element is at a valid index (which would be the old count or less than the old count), and if the index of the inserted element and the last index of the inserted element are at most 1 more than the index of the previously last element or -1 if no element was inserted before the last.

<code>
